+# Patch 0095: Training module plan as a doc
+
+Stacks on 0094. Docs only: no code, tests or help pages change.
+
+## What you asked
+> attach your doc as a part of another patch as a md doc in docs/
+
+## What it does
+- Adds `docs/TRAINING_PLAN.md`: the ordered list of the 50 planned training modules, in five tiers from "cannot use the till without it" to "owner only, set once". Each entry has what it covers, the Guide steps and the Check 2 failure.
+- Marks what is built so far: `welcome`, `sign-in` (0093) and `cart` (0094).
+- Records the rules each new module follows (reserved ids from the remedies table, registering, spots, `taughtBy`, `practiceStaff`).
+- Linked from the B6 line in `docs/PROGRESS.md`, so each module patch can tick itself off there.
+
+## Checklist
+1. [x] `docs/TRAINING_PLAN.md`.
+2. [x] `docs/PROGRESS.md`: patch log row and a pointer on the B6 line.
+3. [x] Suite unchanged: 610 of 611 pass in my sandbox (the one failure, `tests/virtualterminal.test.ts` `DWELL_MS`, fails without this patch too).
